<title>INDONESIA: Telkom rises on Deutsche Telekom talk.</title>
<headline>Telkom rises on Deutsche Telekom talk.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Indonesia's largest telecommunications company PT Telkom rose on Wednesday on market talk that Deutsche Telekom might buy a stake in the firm, brokers said.</p>
<p>Telkom was up 100 rupiah at 3,800 rupiah on a volume of 2.33 million shares by midsession after rising to 3,850 rupiah in early trade.</p>
<p>Brokers in Jakarta said the sudden surge seemed to have resulted from speculation offshore that German telecommunication giant Deutsche Telekom might be looking for a stake in the company. Telkom officials were not available for comment.</p>
</text>
